# Meeting agenda for Monday 16th through Friday 20th November, 2026

This is the proposed agenda for the SPI board Meeting of Monday, November 16th
through 20th 2026, to be hosted by Técnico Universidade de Lisboa, Portugal.

1. 2026-11-16 10:00 to 12:30 UTC/WET
    1. Opening
    2. Roll Call
    3. Monthly business
        1. President's report
        2. Vice President's report
        3. Treasurer's report
        4. Secretary's report
        5. Minutes for [Monday, 12 October, 2026](/meetings/minutes/2026/2026-10-12/)
        6. Next monthly board meeting: December 14, 2026, 20:00 UTC
    4. Outstanding RT topics
    5. Working Session: Triage RT Queues
2. 2026-11-16 13:30 to 17:00 UTC/WET
    1. Roll Call
    2. AI Policy
    3. Crypto Policy
    4. Grants and Gifts Policy
    5. Trademarks Policy
    6. Cards Policy
    7. Other Treasury Topics
    8. Executive Session (nonpublic)
3. 2026-11-17 10:00 to 12:30 UTC/WET
    1. Roll Call
    2. Interest
    3. Auditors
    4. Treasury ACID (Consistency/Integrity/Contingency)
    5. Restricted vs Unrestricted Assets/Donations
    6. Paying for project funding contract overhead
4. 2026-11-17 13:30 to 17:00 UTC/WET
    1. Roll Call
    2. Reimbursement App
    3. Projects Dashboard
    4. Final Treasury Topics
    5. Executive Session (nonpublic)
5. 2026-11-18 10:00 to 12:30 UTC/WET
    1. Roll Call
    2. Committees discussion
    3. Internet Presence
    4. How contractors are arranged
    5. Grants assignment
    6. HR discussion
    7. Legal counsel discussion
6. 2026-11-18 13:30 to 17:00 UTC/WET
    1. Roll Call
    2. Whistleblower Policy
    3. Delegation of Secretary tasks
    4. Process for removal of officers
    5. Leftover VP/Secretary topics
    6. Domain Policy
    7. Opening accounts
    8. Steamworks account
    9. Google Play Console account
    10. Google Groups Archives
    11. Offline backups
    12. Sysadmin process mapping docs
    13. Membership cleaning/expiration
    14. Executive Session (nonpublic)
7. 2026-11-19 10:00 to 12:30 UTC/WET
    1. Roll Call
    2. SPI account access
    3. Service inventory
    4. Unreachable projects
    5. Signing agreements for accounts
    6. Copyright notices
    7. Other Sysadmin Topics
    8. Project Requests
    9. [2023-12-07.jln.2: (REVISED) Formalize SPI 5% fee](draft-2023-12-07.jln.2/)
    10. [2026-11-19.mcs.1: Appointment of Secretary Pro Tempore](draft-2026-11-19.mcs.1/)
8. 2026-11-19 13:30 to 17:00 UTC/WET (nonpublic)
    1. Roll Call
    2. RACI Discussion (Risks Mitigation and Process Mapping)
9. 2026-11-20 10:00 to 12:30 UTC/WET
    1. Roll Call
    2. Age collecting, processing, and gating regulations
    3. Bylaws Discussion
    4. Forming an SPI Branch Entity in Europe
    5. Relationships with Grant-Makers
10. 2026-11-20 13:30 to 17:00 UTC/WET
    1. Roll Call
    2. Associated Project Framework Discussion
    3. Executive Session (nonpublic)

